@@ -3,3 +3,19 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory rental service. Money is integer euro
+cents; times are UTC ISO-8601 strings; a period starts and ends at midnight UTC, `end` being the start of
+the day after the last rented day.
+
+```ts
+const rentals = createRentalService();
+rentals.addEquipment({ id: 'b1', kind: 'board', dailyPrice: 2500 });
+rentals.quote({ itemId: 'b1', start: '2026-07-01T00:00:00Z', end: '2026-07-04T00:00:00Z' }); // total: 7500
+rentals.book({ itemId: 'b1', start: '2026-07-01T00:00:00Z', end: '2026-07-04T00:00:00Z' });
+```
+
+`quote` and `book` throw for an unknown item or an invalid period; `book` also throws when the item is
+already booked for part of the period. Cancellation is not implemented yet.
